      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Using a GPU worker\nto fetch videos from\nthe queue and run\ninference on ASUS\nGX10. Better than\nrenting GPUs by the\nhour. GPU inside is\ncomparable to an L4.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "eocdbp9EweZUSKlEYbA__",
      "originalText": "Using a GPU worker to fetch videos from the queue and run inference on ASUS GX10. Better than renting GPUs by the hour. GPU inside is comparable to an L4.",
